msgstr "Feedzy の自動翻訳を Polyglot アドオンで再作成します。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:363
msgid ""
"WPeMatico <strong>Polyglot needs its translation API configured in Settings</"
